---
import Layout from './../layouts/Layout.astro'
import profilePicture from '../assets/profilepicture.png';
---

<Layout>
    <div id="container">
        <main>
            <div id="card">
                <img id="avatar" src={profilePicture.src} alt="Profile picture" />
                <h1>About me</h1>
                <h6>You're interested in me? owo</h6>
                <hr class="divider" />
                <h2>General</h2>
                <p>
                    Name: Wolfiii<br />
                    Specied: Dragon<br />
                    Furry since: 2013-ish
                </p>
                <hr class="divider" />
                <p>
                    Hi! :3<br /><br />
                    I live in southern Germany and spend too much time on the internet, lol.<br /><br />
                    Uhh, what can I talk about?<br /><br />
                    I love riding my bike (currently Honda CB500 Hornet 2024), cooking and baking pastries.<br />
                    Also I like to go outside and do some walkies in form of hikes 🚶<br /><br />
                    I am straight as a roundabout (not at all 🌈💅)<br /><br />
                    Also from time to time I do photography, but don't expect to see any good pictures c: Check out my furtrack if you wanna see smth.<br /><br />
                    <b>Okay but, you're a dragon named Wolfiii?</b><br />
                    Yes. Confusing, right?<br />
                    Basically I started back then as a Wolf because they're cool as fuck, but at some point (mid-2025) I decided to make a second sona as a dragon but 'till now I haven't decided on a new name.<br />
                    So yeah, I'm Wolfiii the dragon :)<br /><br />
                    Oh, and I work in IT.<br />
                    <i>How original...</i>
                </p>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
</Layout>